WEBVTT

00:05:57.833 --> 00:06:00.226
we do jerk wagyu beef,

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:01.684
shio kombu.

00:06:01.708 --> 00:06:05.667
We remixed the Bronx classic
with the Japanese elements.

00:06:06.875 --> 00:06:08.601
And for Kwanzaa,

00:06:08.625 --> 00:06:11.601
we had to pay homage to our Puerto Ricans,

00:06:11.625 --> 00:06:18.809
and we did a coconut charcoal
cognac coquito. Dímelo!

00:06:18.833 --> 00:06:21.601
(Laughter)

00:06:21.625 --> 00:06:24.893
This here is our Black Power waffle

00:06:24.917 --> 00:06:28.726
with some gold leaf syrup.

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:30.601
Make sure you don't slip on the drip.